{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“直像”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"alias":[{"Plain":"前推"},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"直像"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03PV\" title=\"Stacks 页面 [https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03PV]\">Stacks 页面</a></span></p>\n<p>直像是"},{"Local":{"url":"六函子","text":"六函子"}},{"Plain":"之一.</p>\n<p>对拓扑空间 $X,Y$, 映射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 诱导直像函子 $f_*\\colon \\operatorname{Sh}(X)\\to \\operatorname{Sh(Y)}$. 直像是逆像函子 $f^*$ 的右"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":". 见"},{"Local":{"url":"直像-逆像伴随","text":"直像-逆像伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>有人将前推写成 “积分” 符号. 这与 "},{"Local":{"url":"Fourier--向井变换","text":"Fourier–向井变换"}},{"Plain":"有关.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Noether概形","text":"Noether 概形"}},{"Plain":"的态射. 直像是左正合函子\n$$\r\nf_*\\colon \\mathsf {Qcoh}(X) \\to \\mathsf {Qcoh}(Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>对于态射 $X\\to \\operatorname{pt}$, 直像相当于"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":"函子. 例如 $f\\colon \\mathbb A^1\\to\\text{pt}$. 那么\n$$\r\nf_*\\mathcal O_{\\mathbb A^1}= H^0(\\mathbb A^1,\\mathcal O_{\\mathbb A^1})=K[T].\r\n$$\n$K[T]$ 是 $K$ 上的无限维空间, 这说明对于一般的态射, 直像不保持"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层","text":"凝聚层"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"紧合映射","text":"紧合映射"}},{"Plain":", 直像以及"},{"Local":{"url":"导出前推","text":"导出前推"}},{"Plain":"保持凝聚层.</p>\n"}]}}